{
  "name": "Wrath of the Sea",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you can expend a use of your Wild Shape to manifest a floating orb of water over your hand. The orb remains for 10 minutes. It ends early if you dismiss it (no action required), manifest it again, or have the Incapacitated condition.</p><p>When you manifest the orb and as a Bonus Action on your subsequent turns, you can move the orb up to 30 feet and make a melee spell attack against a creature within 5 feet of it. On a hit, the target takes bludgeoning damage equal to a number of d6 x Proficiency.</p>",
